		<h1>Tianyou Ma</h1>
		<p class="lede">Mathematics Honours student · Australian National University · Canberra</p>
		<p class="quick-links">
			<a href="/files/Tianyou_Ma_CV.pdf">CV (PDF)</a>
			<span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
